{"id":"en_reborn-as-the-vampire-s-only-antidote","title":"Reborn as the Vampire's Only Antidote","titleEn":"Reborn as the Vampire's Only Antidote","description":"Phoebe regains consciousness on the very morning she is required to select the vampire who will claim her blood—after having been tormented and drained by one she had believed she could trust. With this second chance comes an unexpected ability: she can now perceive thoughts that were meant to stay concealed. She picks Sebastian, the aloof heir, but soon finds out that she alone serves as the cure for the deadly poison running through his veins. The decision before her is stark—rescue him at the cost of everything she has, or allow him to perish. Dramzio is where viewers can follow how Phoebe's choice unfolds.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/reborn-as-the-vampires-only-antidote/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/reborn-as-the-vampires-only-antidote/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Fantasy","Romance","Rebirth","Destiny","Vampires","Female"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ddu1e/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_reborn-as-the-vampire-s-only-antidote_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ddu1e/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_reborn-as-the-vampire-s-only-antidote_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ddu1e/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_reborn-as-the-vampire-s-only-antidote_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ddu1e/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable